# A chip's right-click ends on *Move left* / *Move right*: the position
# chip steps left past the file size, the order goes home to
# `ui.statusline_segment_order`, and the next launch lays the row out
# the same way. At 120x40 with a.txt open the position chip spans
# about columns 70-86 of row 38.
write a.txt "hello\n"
open a.txt
expect screen contains "6B  Ln 1/1 Col 1"
rightclick 78 38
expect screen contains "Move left"
expect screen contains "Move right"
# The last two rows: Move left, then Move right.
key end
key up
key enter
expect screen contains "Ln 1/1 Col 1  6B"
expect screen lacks "6B  Ln 1/1 Col 1"
restart
open a.txt
expect screen contains "Ln 1/1 Col 1  6B"
expect screen lacks "6B  Ln 1/1 Col 1"
